      "execution": {
        "startingPosition": "Fasten an ankle cuff to a low pulley. Face away from the machine, stand upright, and hold a stable support lightly. Keep the cable behind the working leg. Compare the entered load only on the same machine and setup.",
        "movement": "Lift the straight working leg forward and upward while keeping your trunk steady.",
        "endpoint": "Stop when the thigh is horizontal, or earlier if you cannot keep the knee straight and the pelvis steady. Pause briefly.",
        "returnPhase": "Lower the leg slowly to the starting position without letting the weight stack settle between repetitions.",
